# N4 (Codex OPUS-CODEX-20261015-23 Q5: an explicit path addresses the physical graph it names; only bare own uses and
# the executable declaring and assigning forms are redirected to the data): S\x inside S is the x of the code graph,
# so S\x: 5 writes the code, not D. int: x has no initializer and writes nothing, so D\x keeps 1. Entry 7.
S:
    int: x
    S\x: 5
end: S
D:
    int: x 1
end: D
call: S D
int: r 81
if: S\x = 5 && D\x = 1
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
